#. type: Title ###
#: ../src/guide/security/best-practices.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "Configuring SSL peer validation"
msgstr "Configurando a validação SSL do peer"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/security/best-practices.md
msgid "There is a typical misconception about how to solve SSL certificate validation issues such as:"
msgstr "Há um equívoco comum sobre como resolver problemas de validação de certificado SSL, como:"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: ../src/guide/security/best-practices.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "cURL error 60: SSL certificate problem: unable to get local issuer certificate\n"
msgstr "cURL error 60: SSL certificate problem: unable to get local issuer certificate\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/security/best-practices.md
msgid "or"
msgstr "ou"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: ../src/guide/security/best-practices.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "stream_socket_enable_crypto(): SSL operation failed with code 1. OpenSSL Error messages: error:1416F086:SSL routines:tls_process_server_certificate:certificate verify failed\n"
msgstr "stream_socket_enable_crypto(): SSL operation failed with code 1. OpenSSL Error messages: error:1416F086:SSL routines:tls_process_server_certificate:certificate verify failed\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/security/best-practices.md
msgid "Many sources wrongly suggest disabling SSL peer verification.  That shouldn't be ever done since it enables man-in-the middle type of attacks.  Instead, PHP should be configured properly:"
msgstr "Muitas fontes sugerem, erroneamente, desativar a verificação SSL do peer.  Isso nunca deve ser feito, porque abre caminho para ataques do tipo man-in-the-middle.  Em vez disso, o PHP deve ser configurado corretamente:"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: ../src/guide/security/best-practices.md
msgid "Download [https://curl.haxx.se/ca/cacert.pem](https://curl.haxx.se/ca/cacert.pem)."
msgstr "Baixe [https://curl.haxx.se/ca/cacert.pem](https://curl.haxx.se/ca/cacert.pem)."

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: ../src/guide/security/best-practices.md
msgid "Add the following to your php.ini:"
msgstr "Adicione o seguinte ao seu php.ini:"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: ../src/guide/security/best-practices.md
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  openssl.cafile=\"/path/to/cacert.pem\"\n"
"  curl.cainfo=\"/path/to/cacert.pem\".\n"
msgstr ""
"  openssl.cafile=\"/path/to/cacert.pem\"\n"
"  curl.cainfo=\"/path/to/cacert.pem\".\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: ../src/guide/security/best-practices.md
msgid "Note that you should keep the file up to date."
msgstr "Note que você deve manter o arquivo atualizado."

